	(text "STEPPER (StepStick socket): STEP = GP6, DIR = GP7,\nEN = GP1 (active low, R13 pull-up keeps it off at boot).\nRST/SLP pulled high. MS1-MS3 open = low, close JP1-JP3\nto pull high (microstep mode depends on the module).\nCoil 1 = J10 pins 1/2 (1B/1A), coil 2 = pins 3/4 (2A/2B)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 345 226 0)
